                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Airtone is an [b]excellent[/b] rythm game with predefined song mappings. In addition to the main gameplay being highly polished, it also features great production quality, solid tech (including great image quality), and extremely aesthetically pleasing design both during the songs and throughout the menu/hub. There is a great variety of unique 3D environments for the songs.\n\nLooking at the achievements versus what I've completed so far in a bit more than 2 hours of gameplay it's quite packed with content too, well worth the purchase at its current price. If I had to criticize anything, the english VA's delivery is slightly clumsy at times - but it's still charming.",
